{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Your brother's.</b> The sons of the concubines." "<b>Your mother's sons.</b> Esau and his sons." "Those who curse you, cursed. Each one of those who curse you, and likewise \"the righteous are bold as a lion\" (Proverbs 28:1), and many are like this, and likewise those who bless you."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:01.409696958Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}